<title>UK: ICI drops after BZW said cut profit estimate.</title>
<headline>ICI drops after BZW said cut profit estimate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Chemical Industries Plc tumbled on Thursday after analysts at BZW cut its profit forecast for the group, traders said.</p>
<p>ICI shares were down 20p at 825-1/2p by 0850 GMT.</p>
<p>Traders said BZW had lowered its 1996 profit forecast to 630 million stg from 680 million stg. Analysts at the brokerage declined comment but denied cutting their stance on the stock.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
